\label{lem:SZqsm}
    The stacks $\mathcal{S}_i$, $\mathcal{Z}_i$ are quasi-smooth, 
    and the maps $\mathcal{S}_i \to \mathcal{Z}_i$, $\mathcal{S}_i \hookrightarrow \mathcal{H}_T(w)^{\mathrm{ss}}$ are quasi-smooth.

 We divide the proof into 2 steps. 
\begin{sstep}
